0006: # concepts:
0007: # pattern reconstruction
0008: 
0009: # description:
0010: # In the input you will see 9 squares seperated by 4 lines. The top-left square contains the original pattern.
0011: # Each square contains either a small portion of pattern or remains empty.
0012: # To make the output, you should detect the pattern on the top-left square and fill each square 
